# Skeletons (Vormia Admin UI)

Use pulse placeholders while data is loading. Prefer these over spinners or emoji loaders.

## Primitive

```tsx
import { Skeleton } from '#/components/ui/skeleton'

<Skeleton className="h-4 w-32" />
```

`animate-pulse` + `bg-muted` + `rounded-md` (shadcn-compatible).

## Page layouts

From `#/components/admin/page-skeletons`:

| Component | Use when |
| :--- | :--- |
| `DashboardSkeleton` | Overview / KPI + charts pending |
| `TablePageSkeleton` | Records / Inventory list pending |
| `SettingsSkeleton` | Settings form pending |

In product apps (e.g. Veyra), mirror lives at `#/components/veyra/page-skeletons`.

## Wiring

- Show the matching skeleton when TanStack Query `isPending` / `isLoading` for that view.
- Kit demo: Settings → Developer → **Preview skeletons** (click handler + `setTimeout`, no `useEffect`).
- Do not invent custom loader GIFs or emoji loading states.
